---
layout: layouts/base.njk
hideNewsletter: true
hideFooter: true
---

<header class="ft-home ft-home__hero">
  <div class="md:max-w-screen-lg mx-auto px-4 py-12 md:py-20 text-center">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-6 mb-8">
      <img
        src="/_assets/misc/logos/kingdom-code.svg"
        alt="Kingdom Code"
        class="h-16 w-16"
      />
      <span class="text-3xl font-bold" aria-hidden="true">&times;</span>
      <span class="block h-16 w-12">
        {% include "../../_assets/misc/logos/faithtech.svg" %}
      </span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">
      Kingdom Code is now part of FaithTech
    </h1>
    <p class="text-lg md:text-xl mb-8">
      We have become part of FaithTech, a global community of Christians in
      tech.
    </p>
    <a
      class="ft-home__cta inline-block font-bold uppercase px-6 py-3 rounded"
      href="{{ faithtech.url }}"
      >Visit FaithTech.com</a
    >
  </div>
</header>

<main class="ft-home ft-home__main md:max-w-screen-lg mx-auto px-4 py-10">
  <p class="font-bold text-lg mb-4">
    When the love of Jesus and a passion for tech collide, exciting things
    happen.
  </p>
  <p class="mb-10">
    Kingdom Code has been a community of people who love Jesus and love tech.
    Together with FaithTech, that community continues: the same people, the same
    heart, now part of a global movement. Find your local community below.
  </p>

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Find your local community in the UK</h2>
  <ul class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 mb-10">
    {%- for community in faithtech.communities %}
    <li>
      <a
        class="ft-home__card block h-full rounded p-6 font-bold text-xl"
        href="{{ community.url }}"
      >
        FaithTech {{ community.name }}
        <span class="ft-home__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
      </a>
    </li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>

  <div class="grid gap-x-6 md:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="flex flex-col mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">{{ faithtech.build.name }}</h2>
      <a
        class="ft-home__build ft-home__feature block flex-1 rounded overflow-hidden"
        href="{{ faithtech.build.url }}"
      >
        <span class="ft-home__imgwrap block overflow-hidden">
          {% rwdImg faithtech.build.image, "People working together at BUILD 2026", "(min-width: 768px) 512px, 100vw", "ft-home__img block w-full" %}
        </span>
        <span class="block p-6">
          <span class="block font-bold text-xl mb-2">
            Join us at BUILD
            <span class="ft-home__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
          </span>
          <span class="block"
            >BUILD brings together Christians in tech to explore how our faith
            in Jesus connects with our technical skills.</span
          >
        </span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">{{ faithtech.playbook.name }}</h2>
      <a
        class="ft-home__playbook ft-home__feature block flex-1 rounded overflow-hidden"
        href="{{ faithtech.playbook.url }}"
      >
        <span class="ft-home__imgwrap block overflow-hidden">
          <img
            class="ft-home__img block w-full"
            src="{{ faithtech.playbook.image }}"
            alt="{{ faithtech.playbook.name }}"
            width="5120"
            height="2412"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </span>
        <span class="block p-6">
          <span class="block font-bold text-xl mb-2">
            Read the Playbook
            <span class="ft-home__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
          </span>
          <span class="block"
            >There is a different way of building technology, a redemptive way.
            Find out more in the FaithTech Playbook.</span
          >
        </span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
